; MADRIGUERA - the whole burrow as one gbe_world map (GDD 9.2): 2x2 sectors = 32x32 cells, rooms of
; 10x8 cells at (col*10, row*8). M1 contains R1 Entrada (1,3), R2 Vestibulo (1,2), R3 Raices (0,2);
; every other cell is EARTH (solid). M1 differences from the GDD 6.3 sketches: R2's north lock and
; east door are wall, R3's topillos and hidden chest are floor. The sign of R1 is the SIGN metatile
; (its 'sign' object with the script comes with the texts, M3). FLOOR2 (pebbles) only as accents.
; Generated by the pixel-artist's scratch script from GDD 6.3; this file is the source of truth now.
@ map MAZMORRA
@ metatiles metatiles
@ size 2 2
@ border EARTH
legend:
# EARTH
. FLOOR
, FLOOR2
- WALL_T
_ WALL_B
[ WALL_L
] WALL_R
1 WALL_TL
2 WALL_TR
3 WALL_BL
4 WALL_BR
a DOOR_T_L
b DOOR_T_R
c DOOR_B_L
d DOOR_B_R
e DOOR_L_U
f DOOR_L_D
g DOOR_R_U
h DOOR_R_D
s STAIRS_L
t STAIRS_R
R BLOCK
~ WATER
T SIGN
